{"status": "ok", "language": null, "cues": [{"t": 0.03, "d": 1.5, "text": "嗨，大家好"}, {"t": 1.53, "d": 2.2, "text": "欢迎回到我的频道"}, {"t": 3.73, "d": 1.3, "text": "我是安吉拉"}, {"t": 5.6, "d": 3.9, "text": "今天继续咱们的中文播客"}, {"t": 9.93, "d": 8.97, "text": "今天，呢我会把视频中出现的十个非常常用的汉语单词标出来"}, {"t": 19.57, "d": 6.0, "text": "并且把它们的意思和发音放到视频的最后"}, {"t": 26.43, "d": 4.3, "text": "我希望大家今天看完这个视频"}, {"t": 30.83, "d": 4.3, "text": "能够掌握十个汉语单词"}, {"t": 35.63, "d": 2.67, "text": "掌握的意思呢就是“学会”"}, {"t": 38.53, "d": 0.93, "text": "掌，手掌"}, {"t": 39.47, "d": 2.23, "text": "握，握住"}, {"t": 42.17, "d": 3.77, "text": "手掌握住，它就是你的东西了"}, {"t": 45.93, "d": 1.4, "text": "你就学会了"}, {"t": 47.5, "d": 1.83, "text": "这就是“掌握”的意思"}, {"t": 49.9, "d": 3.3, "text": "我希望大家今天看完这个视频"}, {"t": 53.2, "d": 3.43, "text": "能够掌握十个单词"}, {"t": 57.2, "d": 5.2, "text": "其实如果一段视频能够学会十个单词的话"}, {"t": 62.47, "d": 2.53, "text": "已经非常非常厉害了"}, {"t": 65.13, "d": 2.57, "text": "好吧咱们现在开始吧"}, {"t": 67.73, "d": 4.53, "text": "今天我想跟大家聊的话题是“凡尔赛”"}, {"t": 72.93, "d": 2.3, "text": "听到凡尔赛这个词呢"}, {"t": 75.27, "d": 4.23, "text": "大家肯定想到的是法国的凡尔赛"}, {"t": 80.1, "d": 5.03, "text": "没错，凡尔赛呢是法国的一个城市"}, {"t": 85.6, "d": 2.63, "text": "应该是在巴黎附近吧"}, {"t": 88.53, "d": 1.27, "text": "我没有去过"}, {"t": 89.8, "d": 2.3, "text": "这是我在网上查的"}, {"t": 92.67, "d": 5.2, "text": "那在那儿呢有一个非常有名的皇宫"}, {"t": 98.23, "d": 6.17, "text": "以前法国国王的一个皇宫，叫凡尔赛宫"}, {"t": 104.67, "d": 3.07, "text": "那这个皇宫非常的豪华"}, {"t": 107.93, "d": 1.6, "text": "也非常的有名"}, {"t": 109.87, "d": 2.57, "text": "像我根本没有去过法国"}, {"t": 112.47, "d": 2.97, "text": "我也听说过这个皇宫"}, {"t": 116.2, "d": 3.13, "text": "那很多去法国旅游的人呢"}, {"t": 119.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "去巴黎旅游的人"}, {"t": 121.63, "d": 4.67, "text": "也一定会去这个凡尔赛宫打卡"}, {"t": 126.4, "d": 3.03, "text": "其实啊中国也有一个“凡尔赛”"}, {"t": 129.73, "d": 2.0, "text": "今天视频的主题呢"}, {"t": 131.73, "d": 4.07, "text": "我就想跟大家聊一聊中国这个凡尔赛"}, {"t": 136.3, "d": 3.63, "text": "中国的凡尔赛不是一个皇宫"}, {"t": 140.23, "d": 1.8, "text": "也不是一个城市"}, {"t": 142.23, "d": 1.27, "text": "不是一个地方"}, {"t": 143.5, "d": 5.9, "text": "它是汉语中、中文中最近新出现的一个单词"}, {"t": 150.33, "d": 1.33, "text": "一个新词"}, {"t": 152.33, "d": 1.67, "text": "最开始的时候呢"}, {"t": 154.0, "d": 2.9, "text": "它是一个网络流行语"}, {"t": 157.13, "d": 2.87, "text": "慢慢地，用的人越来越多"}, {"t": 160.13, "d": 3.7, "text": "尤其是年轻人用的越来越多"}, {"t": 164.07, "d": 4.83, "text": "它现在已经几乎变成了一个常规词汇了"}, {"t": 169.47, "d": 2.77, "text": "大家在学习中文的时候"}, {"t": 172.33, "d": 3.07, "text": "有没有遇见过这个词呢"}, {"t": 175.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "有没有听到过这个词呢"}, {"t": 179.2, "d": 4.33, "text": "如果你经常刷中国的社交媒体"}, {"t": 183.83, "d": 2.3, "text": "看中国的短视频呀"}, {"t": 186.8, "d": 2.43, "text": "或者说你有中国的朋友"}, {"t": 189.47, "d": 2.93, "text": "你可能会看到这样的表达"}, {"t": 192.43, "d": 1.8, "text": "听到这样的表达"}, {"t": 194.93, "d": 2.4, "text": "你这人怎么这么凡尔赛呀"}, {"t": 198.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "你别这么凡尔赛了行吗"}, {"t": 201.03, "d": 2.27, "text": "你这是典型的凡尔赛啊"}, {"t": 204.23, "d": 3.27, "text": "那大家知道凡尔赛是什么意思吗"}, {"t": 208.0, "d": 1.3, "text": "简单的来说"}, {"t": 209.3, "d": 3.1, "text": "凡尔赛是一种说话方式"}, {"t": 212.83, "d": 7.7, "text": "它是用一种抱怨或者不满的语气来炫耀自己的一种说话方式"}, {"t": 221.43, "d": 1.37, "text": "炫耀自己"}, {"t": 222.93, "d": 1.4, "text": "显摆自己"}, {"t": 224.63, "d": 2.57, "text": "显摆也是炫耀的意思"}, {"t": 227.87, "d": 4.27, "text": "炫耀自己很牛、很牛逼、很厉害"}, {"t": 232.13, "d": 2.67, "text": "很有钱或者其他的"}, {"t": 234.83, "d": 1.57, "text": "炫耀什么都可以"}, {"t": 236.53, "d": 1.17, "text": "重点是呢"}, {"t": 237.7, "d": 2.23, "text": "它不是直接的炫耀"}, {"t": 240.13, "d": 2.8, "text": "而是用一种抱怨的语气"}, {"t": 243.1, "d": 1.97, "text": "或者不满的语气"}, {"t": 245.07, "d": 6.13, "text": "在不经意之间炫耀自己的一种说话方式"}, {"t": 251.2, "d": 2.43, "text": "我举个例子大家就知道了"}, {"t": 254.23, "d": 2.23, "text": "比如说一个人跟你说"}, {"t": 257.2, "d": 2.53, "text": "哎我的新房子太烦了"}, {"t": 259.83, "d": 1.8, "text": "房间太多了"}, {"t": 261.87, "d": 4.4, "text": "每天我都要花很长的时间打扫卫生"}, {"t": 266.7, "d": 1.17, "text": "太累了"}, {"t": 268.73, "d": 1.67, "text": "那表面上看呢"}, {"t": 270.5, "d": 5.9, "text": "他是在抱怨每天收拾房间、打扫房间很累"}, {"t": 276.4, "d": 1.4, "text": "那实际上呢"}, {"t": 277.8, "d": 1.93, "text": "或者别人听起来呢"}, {"t": 280.03, "d": 4.63, "text": "其实是他想在表达他的新房子很大"}, {"t": 284.83, "d": 4.9, "text": "他有一个很大的房子、他很有钱"}, {"t": 290.03, "d": 3.67, "text": "你看啊，他没有直接说他很有钱"}, {"t": 293.9, "d": 3.37, "text": "没有直接地炫耀他的房子很大"}, {"t": 297.47, "d": 3.13, "text": "他是用一种不满的语气"}, {"t": 300.6, "d": 2.2, "text": "用一种很烦的语气"}, {"t": 302.87, "d": 3.27, "text": "不经意之间炫耀了他的房子"}, {"t": 306.7, "d": 4.33, "text": "这就是一种典型的凡尔赛的说话方式"}, {"t": 311.53, "d": 5.1, "text": "那我们也把这种说话方式叫做“凡尔赛文学”"}, {"t": 317.27, "d": 3.47, "text": "这里的文学并不是一个学科"}, {"t": 321.1, "d": 3.33, "text": "它是一种调侃的方式"}, {"t": 324.47, "d": 2.97, "text": "或者说是一种开玩笑的方式"}, {"t": 327.7, "d": 3.53, "text": "甚至是有一些讽刺"}, {"t": 331.23, "d": 3.37, "text": "来讽刺这种炫耀的说话方式"}, {"t": 334.83, "d": 1.83, "text": "对它是一种讽刺"}, {"t": 336.73, "d": 2.93, "text": "所以说它是凡尔赛文学"}, {"t": 339.8, "d": 1.53, "text": "大家能理解吗"}, {"t": 341.47, "d": 2.87, "text": "凡尔赛这个词儿是怎么来的呢"}, {"t": 344.73, "d": 4.37, "text": "虽然我在生活中也会经常说这个词"}, {"t": 349.3, "d": 3.43, "text": "但是我还真不知道它是怎么来的"}, {"t": 353.4, "d": 2.73, "text": "于是我就去上网查了一下"}, {"t": 356.73, "d": 3.53, "text": "原来是在2020年的时候"}, {"t": 360.47, "d": 1.77, "text": "大概六年前了"}, {"t": 362.7, "d": 7.3, "text": "有一个人在网上用这种方式炫耀她自己的生活"}, {"t": 370.3, "d": 3.17, "text": "显摆她自己豪华的生活"}, {"t": 373.8, "d": 1.9, "text": "显摆她很有钱"}, {"t": 375.8, "d": 4.43, "text": "显摆她自己的豪宅，很豪华的房子"}, {"t": 380.23, "d": 2.87, "text": "显摆她的老公特别宠爱她"}, {"t": 383.7, "d": 3.33, "text": "很多人看到之后都给她评论"}, {"t": 387.5, "d": 1.63, "text": "其中有一个人呀"}, {"t": 389.47, "d": 3.23, "text": "认为她这种炫耀的方式"}, {"t": 392.87, "d": 2.2, "text": "她炫耀的这些东西"}, {"t": 395.3, "d": 5.37, "text": "特别像一部日本漫画《凡尔赛玫瑰》"}, {"t": 400.73, "d": 4.6, "text": "这本漫画中描写的法国贵族的生活"}, {"t": 405.33, "d": 7.57, "text": "于是呢就用凡尔赛这个词来讽刺她的这种炫耀"}, {"t": 412.9, "d": 3.1, "text": "慢慢地，这个词就流传开了"}, {"t": 417.1, "d": 5.03, "text": "现在就变成了一个大家非常常用的一个词汇了"}, {"t": 422.83, "d": 2.63, "text": "咱们现在再举几个例子"}, {"t": 425.47, "d": 4.87, "text": "看看凡尔赛这种炫耀的方式有什么特点"}, {"t": 431.03, "d": 6.07, "text": "第一个特点就是先贬低自己、再抬高自己"}, {"t": 437.1, "d": 2.13, "text": "贬低、抬高"}, {"t": 439.4, "d": 2.73, "text": "先把自己说得很不好"}, {"t": 442.3, "d": 4.03, "text": "然后呢再让大家觉得他很好"}, {"t": 446.5, "d": 3.6, "text": "这就叫先贬低自己，把自己放低"}, {"t": 450.2, "d": 1.63, "text": "把自己弄得很低"}, {"t": 452.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "再把自己弄得很高"}, {"t": 454.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "贬低、抬高"}, {"t": 456.47, "d": 1.23, "text": "也就是说"}, {"t": 457.7, "d": 2.9, "text": "说话的时候先说自己不好"}, {"t": 461.1, "d": 3.23, "text": "很烦、很烦恼、很不满"}, {"t": 464.4, "d": 6.1, "text": "实际上呢，是想让大家觉得他自己很厉害、很牛逼"}, {"t": 470.8, "d": 2.4, "text": "那比如说有一个人跟你说"}, {"t": 473.4, "d": 2.43, "text": "哎呀我每天早上太烦了"}, {"t": 475.83, "d": 1.8, "text": "柜子里都是包儿"}, {"t": 477.7, "d": 4.23, "text": "我都不知道每天背哪个包儿出门"}, {"t": 482.0, "d": 2.07, "text": "她是在烦恼吗？"}, {"t": 484.47, "d": 3.37, "text": "不是，她其实是在炫耀自己"}, {"t": 487.83, "d": 2.6, "text": "她有很多名牌包儿"}, {"t": 490.43, "d": 2.03, "text": "有很多大牌儿的包儿"}, {"t": 492.9, "d": 0.93, "text": "再比如说"}, {"t": 493.83, "d": 1.5, "text": "有一个人跟你说"}, {"t": 495.47, "d": 1.07, "text": "哎呀真烦"}, {"t": 496.53, "d": 2.07, "text": "我每天吃这么多东西"}, {"t": 498.6, "d": 1.43, "text": "我就是不长肉"}, {"t": 500.03, "d": 2.63, "text": "我什么时候才能胖一点啊"}, {"t": 503.03, "d": 4.0, "text": "表面上她是在抱怨自己、嫌自己瘦"}, {"t": 507.2, "d": 2.8, "text": "嫌自己吃东西不长肉"}, {"t": 510.1, "d": 3.2, "text": "实际上呢、或者别人听起来呢"}, {"t": 513.43, "d": 5.23, "text": "她是在炫耀自己不管怎么吃都不会长胖"}, {"t": 518.83, "d": 2.03, "text": "都有一个好的身材"}, {"t": 521.07, "d": 3.73, "text": "那么胖子听见的话会很生气的，对不对"}, {"t": 525.07, "d": 1.27, "text": "第二个特点"}, {"t": 526.33, "d": 3.77, "text": "凡尔赛的人呢说话会很随意"}, {"t": 530.23, "d": 3.3, "text": "在不经意之间炫耀自己"}, {"t": 534.0, "d": 2.47, "text": "他们不会直接地炫耀"}, {"t": 536.47, "d": 3.17, "text": "不会直接跟你说你看我多有钱"}, {"t": 539.8, "d": 2.1, "text": "你看我老公对我多好"}, {"t": 542.07, "d": 1.37, "text": "你看我多聪明"}, {"t": 543.9, "d": 1.93, "text": "那这些不是凡尔赛"}, {"t": 545.87, "d": 1.6, "text": "这些太直接了"}, {"t": 547.53, "d": 3.47, "text": "这种直接的炫耀不是凡尔赛哦"}, {"t": 551.3, "d": 3.63, "text": "凡尔赛的人呢会用很随意的语气"}, {"t": 556.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "好像不小心说出来一样"}, {"t": 558.83, "d": 2.7, "text": "假装自己不是在炫耀"}, {"t": 562.03, "d": 0.8, "text": "那比如说"}, {"t": 562.83, "d": 1.97, "text": "有一个人跟你说，"}, {"t": 564.83, "d": 3.9, "text": "哎，我家旁边的那个大牌，LV店"}, {"t": 569.0, "d": 3.3, "text": "我今天路过的时候，发现有好多人啊"}, {"t": 572.4, "d": 5.3, "text": "我才想起来，我上次新买的包儿我还没背过呢"}, {"t": 578.13, "d": 3.27, "text": "那这就是一个不经意的炫耀"}, {"t": 581.47, "d": 2.73, "text": "她好像在随便的聊天儿"}, {"t": 584.4, "d": 6.67, "text": "但是呢你又可以听出来她在炫耀自己住的地方很繁华"}, {"t": 591.3, "d": 1.83, "text": "旁边就是LV店"}, {"t": 593.43, "d": 1.63, "text": "她还有很多包儿"}, {"t": 595.1, "d": 3.4, "text": "她有很多LV的包儿都背不过来"}, {"t": 598.53, "d": 2.17, "text": "太多了，没有时间背"}, {"t": 601.1, "d": 4.1, "text": "那这就是一种不经意之间的炫耀"}, {"t": 605.7, "d": 1.23, "text": "第三个特点"}, {"t": 606.93, "d": 5.07, "text": "凡尔赛的人呢喜欢用别人的话来夸自己"}, {"t": 612.2, "d": 3.8, "text": "他不是直接用自己的话来炫耀"}, {"t": 616.03, "d": 2.3, "text": "而是通过别人的嘴"}, {"t": 618.33, "d": 3.97, "text": "通过别人说的话来炫耀自己"}, {"t": 622.8, "d": 4.57, "text": "比如说哎呀我男朋友总说我像一个明星"}, {"t": 627.67, "d": 2.47, "text": "他每天都说我很像那个明星"}, {"t": 630.13, "d": 1.33, "text": "我都烦死了"}, {"t": 631.47, "d": 2.87, "text": "我一点儿都不想和明星长得一样"}, {"t": 634.87, "d": 6.2, "text": "那这个就是用男朋友的话来炫耀自己长得很漂亮"}, {"t": 641.07, "d": 1.63, "text": "长得像明星"}, {"t": 643.07, "d": 3.4, "text": "这就是凡尔赛的三个特点"}, {"t": 646.7, "d": 1.73, "text": "那大家可能会问"}, {"t": 648.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "中国人为什么会凡尔赛呢"}, {"t": 651.53, "d": 2.6, "text": "有话直接说不好吗"}, {"t": 654.47, "d": 2.07, "text": "这是一个很好的问题"}, {"t": 656.93, "d": 3.17, "text": "其实啊在中国的文化里"}, {"t": 660.23, "d": 2.87, "text": "大家特别喜欢谦虚"}, {"t": 663.43, "d": 2.97, "text": "如果你直接地炫耀自己"}, {"t": 666.4, "d": 4.13, "text": "我很漂亮、我很牛、我很有钱"}, {"t": 670.8, "d": 2.43, "text": "那会显得你特别不谦虚"}, {"t": 673.43, "d": 2.5, "text": "大家觉得你太骄傲了"}, {"t": 676.1, "d": 1.43, "text": "在中国的文化里"}, {"t": 677.53, "d": 2.2, "text": "谦虚才是美德"}, {"t": 680.3, "d": 2.77, "text": "但是呢现在又有很多人"}, {"t": 683.23, "d": 3.5, "text": "特别希望别人知道自己过得好"}, {"t": 686.73, "d": 1.97, "text": "知道自己很有钱"}, {"t": 688.83, "d": 1.83, "text": "知道自己很成功"}, {"t": 690.9, "d": 3.9, "text": "所以呢他们找到了这种“聪明”的方式"}, {"t": 695.0, "d": 5.37, "text": "用一种抱怨的语气、不满的语气来炫耀自己"}, {"t": 700.5, "d": 1.53, "text": "这样他们就可以说"}, {"t": 702.03, "d": 1.8, "text": "我没有在炫耀呀"}, {"t": 703.83, "d": 2.77, "text": "我只是在说我自己的不满"}, {"t": 707.0, "d": 6.07, "text": "可是听的人，一听就能知道他们是在炫耀自己"}, {"t": 713.3, "d": 5.17, "text": "所以说凡尔赛这个词，其实是有一点儿贬义的"}, {"t": 718.7, "d": 3.4, "text": "大家其实不喜欢这种说话方式"}, {"t": 722.53, "d": 3.53, "text": "觉得这种说话方式太做作了"}, {"t": 726.1, "d": 1.7, "text": "太不真诚了"}, {"t": 728.47, "d": 3.2, "text": "当一个人跟你说，“你别凡尔赛了”"}, {"t": 732.03, "d": 1.47, "text": "其实他的意思是"}, {"t": 733.6, "d": 5.1, "text": "行了行了，你别炫耀了，我知道你在显摆，别装了"}, {"t": 738.97, "d": 3.5, "text": "好啦现在你知道凡尔赛的意思了吧"}, {"t": 742.47, "d": 3.57, "text": "最后呢咱们再看看凡尔赛的用法"}, {"t": 746.5, "d": 1.37, "text": "第一种用法"}, {"t": 747.9, "d": 3.03, "text": "直接把它当做形容词"}, {"t": 751.13, "d": 1.73, "text": "你可以直接说一个人"}, {"t": 752.93, "d": 1.9, "text": "你也太凡尔赛了"}, {"t": 754.9, "d": 1.5, "text": "那这是形容词"}, {"t": 756.83, "d": 1.5, "text": "第二个用法呢"}, {"t": 758.33, "d": 3.67, "text": "是动词，你别凡尔赛了"}, {"t": 762.2, "d": 1.9, "text": "你现在是在凡尔赛"}, {"t": 765.03, "d": 2.77, "text": "意思是你现在是在炫耀"}, {"t": 768.43, "d": 5.0, "text": "那第三种用法呢也可以当成一个名词"}, {"t": 773.53, "d": 3.17, "text": "比如说，你这是典型的凡尔赛"}, {"t": 777.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "你这是典型的炫耀行为"}, {"t": 780.03, "d": 3.27, "text": "好了凡尔赛今天就讲到这儿"}, {"t": 783.83, "d": 3.37, "text": "你们明白它的意思和用法了吗"}, {"t": 787.53, "d": 1.77, "text": "如果你们听明白了"}, {"t": 789.3, "d": 4.6, "text": "可以在评论区写一句凡尔赛的话"}, {"t": 794.07, "d": 2.37, "text": "让我看看你学会了吗"}, {"t": 796.63, "d": 2.7, "text": "好吧今天的视频就到这儿"}, {"t": 799.6, "d": 1.93, "text": "感谢大家的收看"}, {"t": 801.53, "d": 1.9, "text": "如果你喜欢我的频道"}, {"t": 803.47, "d": 2.57, "text": "一定要订阅哦拜拜"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 0.03, "d": 1.5, "text": "Hi everyone,"}, {"t": 1.53, "d": 2.2, "text": "welcome back to my channel."}, {"t": 3.73, "d": 1.3, "text": "I'm Angela."}, {"t": 5.6, "d": 3.9, "text": "Today, we'll continue our Chinese podcast."}, {"t": 9.93, "d": 8.97, "text": "Today, I'll mark ten very commonly used Chinese words that appear in the video"}, {"t": 19.57, "d": 6.0, "text": "and put their meanings and pronunciations at the end."}, {"t": 26.43, "d": 4.3, "text": "I hope that after watching this video,"}, {"t": 30.83, "d": 4.3, "text": "you can master these ten Chinese words."}, {"t": 35.63, "d": 2.67, "text": "\"Master\" means \"to learn.\" \"Palm\" is"}, {"t": 38.53, "d": 0.93, "text": "the palm of the hand. To grasp"}, {"t": 42.17, "d": 3.77, "text": ", to hold, to hold firmly, means that something is yours,"}, {"t": 45.93, "d": 1.4, "text": "and you have learned it."}, {"t": 47.5, "d": 1.83, "text": "That's the meaning of \"mastering.\""}, {"t": 49.9, "d": 3.3, "text": "I hope everyone can master ten words"}, {"t": 53.2, "d": 3.43, "text": "after watching this video today."}, {"t": 57.2, "d": 5.2, "text": "Actually, if you can learn ten words from one video,"}, {"t": 62.47, "d": 2.53, "text": "that's already very impressive."}, {"t": 65.13, "d": 2.57, "text": "Okay, let's begin."}, {"t": 67.73, "d": 4.53, "text": "Today, I want to talk about \"Versailles.\" When you"}, {"t": 72.93, "d": 2.3, "text": "hear the word Versailles,"}, {"t": 75.27, "d": 4.23, "text": "you probably think of Versailles in France."}, {"t": 80.1, "d": 5.03, "text": "That's right, Versailles is a city"}, {"t": 85.6, "d": 2.63, "text": "in France, probably near Paris."}, {"t": 88.53, "d": 1.27, "text": "I haven't been there;"}, {"t": 89.8, "d": 2.3, "text": "this is what I found online."}, {"t": 92.67, "d": 5.2, "text": "There's a very famous palace there,"}, {"t": 98.23, "d": 6.17, "text": "formerly the palace of the French kings, called the Palace of Versailles."}, {"t": 104.67, "d": 3.07, "text": "This palace is very luxurious"}, {"t": 107.93, "d": 1.6, "text": "and very famous."}, {"t": 109.87, "d": 2.57, "text": "Even though I've never been to France,"}, {"t": 112.47, "d": 2.97, "text": "I've heard of this palace."}, {"t": 116.2, "d": 3.13, "text": "Many tourists who go"}, {"t": 119.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "to France or Paris"}, {"t": 121.63, "d": 4.67, "text": "will definitely visit the Palace of Versailles."}, {"t": 126.4, "d": 3.03, "text": "Actually, there's also a \"Versailles\" in China."}, {"t": 129.73, "d": 2.0, "text": "Today's video topic is"}, {"t": 131.73, "d": 4.07, "text": "about the Chinese Versailles. The"}, {"t": 136.3, "d": 3.63, "text": "Chinese Versailles isn't a palace"}, {"t": 140.23, "d": 1.8, "text": ", nor a city"}, {"t": 142.23, "d": 1.27, "text": ", nor a place."}, {"t": 143.5, "d": 5.9, "text": "It's a newly emerging word"}, {"t": 150.33, "d": 1.33, "text": "in Chinese, a very recent"}, {"t": 152.33, "d": 1.67, "text": "one. Initially,"}, {"t": 154.0, "d": 2.9, "text": "it was a popular internet slang term."}, {"t": 157.13, "d": 2.87, "text": "Gradually, more and more people"}, {"t": 160.13, "d": 3.7, "text": ", especially young people, used"}, {"t": 164.07, "d": 4.83, "text": "it, and now it has almost become a regular word."}, {"t": 169.47, "d": 2.77, "text": "Have you encountered"}, {"t": 172.33, "d": 3.07, "text": "or heard this word"}, {"t": 175.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "when learning Chinese ?"}, {"t": 179.2, "d": 4.33, "text": "If you frequently browse Chinese social media,"}, {"t": 183.83, "d": 2.3, "text": "watch Chinese short videos,"}, {"t": 186.8, "d": 2.43, "text": "or have Chinese friends,"}, {"t": 189.47, "d": 2.93, "text": "you might see"}, {"t": 192.43, "d": 1.8, "text": "or hear expressions like, \""}, {"t": 194.93, "d": 2.4, "text": "Why are you so Versailles?\" or \""}, {"t": 198.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "Don't be so Versailles, okay?"}, {"t": 201.03, "d": 2.27, "text": "You're a typical Versailles!"}, {"t": 204.23, "d": 3.27, "text": "\" Do you know what \"Versailles\" means?"}, {"t": 208.0, "d": 1.3, "text": "Simply put,"}, {"t": 209.3, "d": 3.1, "text": "\"Versailles\" is a way of speaking."}, {"t": 212.83, "d": 7.7, "text": "It's a way of speaking that uses a complaining or dissatisfied tone to show off."}, {"t": 221.43, "d": 1.37, "text": "Showing"}, {"t": 222.93, "d": 1.4, "text": "off means boasting, bragging, being awesome, powerful"}, {"t": 224.63, "d": 2.57, "text": ","}, {"t": 227.87, "d": 4.27, "text": "rich,"}, {"t": 232.13, "d": 2.67, "text": "or anything else."}, {"t": 234.83, "d": 1.57, "text": "The"}, {"t": 236.53, "d": 1.17, "text": "key point is that"}, {"t": 237.7, "d": 2.23, "text": "it's not direct boasting"}, {"t": 240.13, "d": 2.8, "text": ", but rather a way of speaking that uses a complaining"}, {"t": 243.1, "d": 1.97, "text": "or dissatisfied tone"}, {"t": 245.07, "d": 6.13, "text": "to subtly show off."}, {"t": 251.2, "d": 2.43, "text": "Let me give you an example."}, {"t": 254.23, "d": 2.23, "text": "For instance, someone might say to you,"}, {"t": 257.2, "d": 2.53, "text": "\"Oh, my new house is so annoying,"}, {"t": 259.83, "d": 1.8, "text": "there are too many rooms,"}, {"t": 261.87, "d": 4.4, "text": "I have to...\""}, {"t": 266.7, "d": 1.17, "text": "On the surface,"}, {"t": 268.73, "d": 1.67, "text": "he's complaining about how tiring it is to clean and tidy his house every day."}, {"t": 270.5, "d": 5.9, "text": "But actually"}, {"t": 276.4, "d": 1.4, "text": ","}, {"t": 277.8, "d": 1.93, "text": "or what others might hear,"}, {"t": 280.03, "d": 4.63, "text": "he's expressing that his new house is very big,"}, {"t": 284.83, "d": 4.9, "text": "that he has a large house, and that he's very rich."}, {"t": 290.03, "d": 3.67, "text": "You see, he didn't directly say he's rich"}, {"t": 293.9, "d": 3.37, "text": "or flaunt his house's size;"}, {"t": 297.47, "d": 3.13, "text": "he used a tone of dissatisfaction"}, {"t": 300.6, "d": 2.2, "text": "and"}, {"t": 302.87, "d": 3.27, "text": "annoyance to subtly show off his house."}, {"t": 306.7, "d": 4.33, "text": "This is a typical Versailles way of speaking,"}, {"t": 311.53, "d": 5.1, "text": "which we also call \"Versailles literature.\""}, {"t": 317.27, "d": 3.47, "text": "Here, \"literature\" doesn't refer to a specific academic discipline"}, {"t": 321.1, "d": 3.33, "text": "; it's a way of teasing"}, {"t": 324.47, "d": 2.97, "text": ", joking"}, {"t": 327.7, "d": 3.53, "text": ", or even satirizing"}, {"t": 331.23, "d": 3.37, "text": "this boastful way of speaking."}, {"t": 334.83, "d": 1.83, "text": "It's a form of satire,"}, {"t": 336.73, "d": 2.93, "text": "hence the term \"Versailles literature.\""}, {"t": 339.8, "d": 1.53, "text": "Do you understand?"}, {"t": 341.47, "d": 2.87, "text": "Where did the word \"Versailles\" come from?"}, {"t": 344.73, "d": 4.37, "text": "Although I often use this word in my daily life"}, {"t": 349.3, "d": 3.43, "text": ", I didn't really know where it came from."}, {"t": 353.4, "d": 2.73, "text": "So I looked it up online."}, {"t": 356.73, "d": 3.53, "text": "It turns out that around 2020,"}, {"t": 360.47, "d": 1.77, "text": "about six years ago,"}, {"t": 362.7, "d": 7.3, "text": "someone online used this method to flaunt their"}, {"t": 370.3, "d": 3.17, "text": "luxurious lifestyle"}, {"t": 373.8, "d": 1.9, "text": ". She"}, {"t": 375.8, "d": 4.43, "text": "flaunted her wealth, showing off her mansion and luxurious house,"}, {"t": 380.23, "d": 2.87, "text": "and how much her husband doted on her."}, {"t": 383.7, "d": 3.33, "text": "Many people commented on her after seeing this."}, {"t": 387.5, "d": 1.63, "text": "One person"}, {"t": 389.47, "d": 3.23, "text": "thought her way of showing off"}, {"t": 392.87, "d": 2.2, "text": "and what she was flaunting"}, {"t": 395.3, "d": 5.37, "text": "was very similar to the life of French nobles depicted in"}, {"t": 400.73, "d": 4.6, "text": "the Japanese manga \"The Rose of Versailles.\""}, {"t": 405.33, "d": 7.57, "text": "So, the word \"Versailles\" was used to satirize her ostentatious display."}, {"t": 412.9, "d": 3.1, "text": "Gradually, the word spread and"}, {"t": 417.1, "d": 5.03, "text": "has now become a very common term."}, {"t": 422.83, "d": 2.63, "text": "Let's look at a few more examples"}, {"t": 425.47, "d": 4.87, "text": "to see what the characteristics of this Versailles-style ostentation are."}, {"t": 431.03, "d": 6.07, "text": "The first characteristic is to first belittle oneself and then elevate oneself."}, {"t": 437.1, "d": 2.13, "text": "Belittling and elevating"}, {"t": 439.4, "d": 2.73, "text": "oneself means first saying that one is bad,"}, {"t": 442.3, "d": 4.03, "text": "then making others think that one is good."}, {"t": 446.5, "d": 3.6, "text": "This is called belittling oneself, putting oneself down"}, {"t": 450.2, "d": 1.63, "text": ", and then"}, {"t": 452.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "elevating oneself"}, {"t": 454.07, "d": 2.0, "text": ". In other"}, {"t": 456.47, "d": 1.23, "text": "words,"}, {"t": 457.7, "d": 2.9, "text": "when speaking, one first says that one is"}, {"t": 461.1, "d": 3.23, "text": "bad, annoyed, and dissatisfied"}, {"t": 464.4, "d": 6.1, "text": ", but actually wants others to think that one is very powerful and awesome."}, {"t": 470.8, "d": 2.4, "text": "For example, if someone says to you,"}, {"t": 473.4, "d": 2.43, "text": "\"Oh, I'm so annoyed every morning."}, {"t": 475.83, "d": 1.8, "text": "My closet is full of bags,"}, {"t": 477.7, "d": 4.23, "text": "and I don't know which bag to take with me every day,"}, {"t": 482.0, "d": 2.07, "text": "\" is she really annoyed?"}, {"t": 484.47, "d": 3.37, "text": "No, she's actually showing off."}, {"t": 487.83, "d": 2.6, "text": "She has so many designer bags"}, {"t": 490.43, "d": 2.03, "text": ", so many high-end bags."}, {"t": 492.9, "d": 0.93, "text": "For example, if"}, {"t": 493.83, "d": 1.5, "text": "someone says to you,"}, {"t": 495.47, "d": 1.07, "text": "\"Ugh, it's so annoying!"}, {"t": 496.53, "d": 2.07, "text": "I eat so much every day, but I"}, {"t": 498.6, "d": 1.43, "text": "just don't gain weight"}, {"t": 500.03, "d": 2.63, "text": ". When will I ever get fat?\""}, {"t": 503.03, "d": 4.0, "text": "On the surface, she's complaining about herself, about being too thin,"}, {"t": 507.2, "d": 2.8, "text": "about not gaining weight no matter how much she eats."}, {"t": 510.1, "d": 3.2, "text": "But actually, or what others hear,"}, {"t": 513.43, "d": 5.23, "text": "she's showing off that she can eat whatever she wants and never gain weight,"}, {"t": 518.83, "d": 2.03, "text": "that she always has a great figure"}, {"t": 521.07, "d": 3.73, "text": ". A fat person would be very angry if they heard that, right?"}, {"t": 525.07, "d": 1.27, "text": "The second characteristic"}, {"t": 526.33, "d": 3.77, "text": "is that people from Versailles speak very casually,"}, {"t": 530.23, "d": 3.3, "text": "subtly"}, {"t": 534.0, "d": 2.47, "text": "showing off. They don't directly show off;"}, {"t": 536.47, "d": 3.17, "text": "they don't say things like, \"Look how rich I am,"}, {"t": 539.8, "d": 2.1, "text": "look how good my husband is to me,"}, {"t": 542.07, "d": 1.37, "text": "look how smart I am."}, {"t": 543.9, "d": 1.93, "text": "\" That's not Versailles"}, {"t": 545.87, "d": 1.6, "text": ". That kind"}, {"t": 547.53, "d": 3.47, "text": "of direct showing off isn't Versailles."}, {"t": 551.3, "d": 3.63, "text": "People from Versailles use a very casual tone,"}, {"t": 556.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "as if they're quite..."}, {"t": 558.83, "d": 2.7, "text": "They pretend they're not showing off,"}, {"t": 562.03, "d": 0.8, "text": "like"}, {"t": 562.83, "d": 1.97, "text": "someone saying, \"Hey,"}, {"t": 564.83, "d": 3.9, "text": "I saw so many people at the LV store next to my house today, and"}, {"t": 569.0, "d": 3.3, "text": "I just remembered I haven't even used my new bag yet!\""}, {"t": 572.4, "d": 5.3, "text": "That's unintentional showing"}, {"t": 578.13, "d": 3.27, "text": "off"}, {"t": 581.47, "d": 2.73, "text": ". They seem to be chatting casually"}, {"t": 584.4, "d": 6.67, "text": ", but you can also hear them bragging about how bustling their neighborhood is, right"}, {"t": 591.3, "d": 1.83, "text": "next to an LV store"}, {"t": 593.43, "d": 1.63, "text": ", and how many bags"}, {"t": 595.1, "d": 3.4, "text": "they own—too many to carry"}, {"t": 598.53, "d": 2.17, "text": ", no time to use them all."}, {"t": 601.1, "d": 4.1, "text": "That's a kind of unintentional showing off."}, {"t": 605.7, "d": 1.23, "text": "The third characteristic"}, {"t": 606.93, "d": 5.07, "text": "is that people from Versailles like to use other people's words to praise themselves."}, {"t": 612.2, "d": 3.8, "text": "They don't directly use their own words to boast"}, {"t": 616.03, "d": 2.3, "text": ", but rather through the words of others"}, {"t": 618.33, "d": 3.97, "text": "."}, {"t": 622.8, "d": 4.57, "text": "For example, \"Oh, my boyfriend always says I look like a celebrity."}, {"t": 627.67, "d": 2.47, "text": "He says I look like that celebrity every day.\""}, {"t": 630.13, "d": 1.33, "text": "I'm so annoyed,"}, {"t": 631.47, "d": 2.87, "text": "I don't want to look like a celebrity at all."}, {"t": 634.87, "d": 6.2, "text": "This is using your boyfriend's words to brag about how beautiful you are"}, {"t": 641.07, "d": 1.63, "text": "and how you look like a celebrity."}, {"t": 643.07, "d": 3.4, "text": "These are the three characteristics of Versailles."}, {"t": 646.7, "d": 1.73, "text": "Now, you might ask,"}, {"t": 648.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "why do Chinese people use Versailles?"}, {"t": 651.53, "d": 2.6, "text": "Can't they just say what they mean?"}, {"t": 654.47, "d": 2.07, "text": "That's a good question"}, {"t": 656.93, "d": 3.17, "text": ". Actually, in Chinese culture, people"}, {"t": 660.23, "d": 2.87, "text": "particularly value humility."}, {"t": 663.43, "d": 2.97, "text": "If you directly brag about"}, {"t": 666.4, "d": 4.13, "text": "how beautiful, powerful, and rich you are"}, {"t": 670.8, "d": 2.43, "text": ", it will seem like you're not humble at all,"}, {"t": 673.43, "d": 2.5, "text": "and people will think you're too arrogant."}, {"t": 676.1, "d": 1.43, "text": "In Chinese culture,"}, {"t": 677.53, "d": 2.2, "text": "humility is a virtue."}, {"t": 680.3, "d": 2.77, "text": "However, nowadays, many people"}, {"t": 683.23, "d": 3.5, "text": "especially want others to know that they are doing well"}, {"t": 686.73, "d": 1.97, "text": ", that they are rich"}, {"t": 688.83, "d": 1.83, "text": ", and that they are successful."}, {"t": 690.9, "d": 3.9, "text": "So, they've found this \"clever\" way:"}, {"t": 695.0, "d": 5.37, "text": "using a complaining, dissatisfied tone to brag about themselves."}, {"t": 700.5, "d": 1.53, "text": "This way, they can say,"}, {"t": 702.03, "d": 1.8, "text": "\"I'm not bragging,"}, {"t": 703.83, "d": 2.77, "text": "I'm just expressing my dissatisfaction"}, {"t": 707.0, "d": 6.07, "text": ".\" But the listener can immediately tell they're bragging."}, {"t": 713.3, "d": 5.17, "text": "So, the word \"Versailles\" actually has a slightly derogatory connotation."}, {"t": 718.7, "d": 3.4, "text": "People generally dislike this way of speaking,"}, {"t": 722.53, "d": 3.53, "text": "finding it"}, {"t": 726.1, "d": 1.7, "text": "too pretentious and insincere."}, {"t": 728.47, "d": 3.2, "text": "When someone tells you, \"Stop being so Versailles,\""}, {"t": 732.03, "d": 1.47, "text": "they actually mean"}, {"t": 733.6, "d": 5.1, "text": ", \"Okay , okay, stop showing off. I know you're bragging, stop pretending.\""}, {"t": 738.97, "d": 3.5, "text": "Now you know what \"Versailles\" means, right?"}, {"t": 742.47, "d": 3.57, "text": "Finally, let's look at the usage of \"Versailles.\""}, {"t": 746.5, "d": 1.37, "text": "The first usage"}, {"t": 747.9, "d": 3.03, "text": "is as an adjective;"}, {"t": 751.13, "d": 1.73, "text": "you can directly say, \""}, {"t": 752.93, "d": 1.9, "text": "You're so Versailles!\""}, {"t": 754.9, "d": 1.5, "text": "That's an adjective."}, {"t": 756.83, "d": 1.5, "text": "The second usage is"}, {"t": 758.33, "d": 3.67, "text": "as a verb: \"Stop being so Versailles!"}, {"t": 762.2, "d": 1.9, "text": "You're being so Versailles right now!"}, {"t": 765.03, "d": 2.77, "text": "\" meaning you're showing off."}, {"t": 768.43, "d": 5.0, "text": "The third usage can also be as a noun"}, {"t": 773.53, "d": 3.17, "text": ", for example, \"This is typical Versailles!"}, {"t": 777.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "This is typical showing off!\""}, {"t": 780.03, "d": 3.27, "text": "Okay, that's all for today's explanation of \"Versailles.\""}, {"t": 783.83, "d": 3.37, "text": "Do you understand its meaning and usage?"}, {"t": 787.53, "d": 1.77, "text": "If you understand,"}, {"t": 789.3, "d": 4.6, "text": "you can write a Versailles phrase in the comments section"}, {"t": 794.07, "d": 2.37, "text": "to let me know if you've learned it."}, {"t": 796.63, "d": 2.7, "text": "Okay, that's all for today's video."}, {"t": 799.6, "d": 1.93, "text": "Thank you for watching."}, {"t": 801.53, "d": 1.9, "text": "If you like my channel,"}, {"t": 803.47, "d": 2.57, "text": "please subscribe! Bye!"}], "video_id": "KQ_aGYuufuI"}